  # ha-li-plugins
  
  Claude Code plugins for everyday git work.
  
  ## Install
  
  ```
  /plugin marketplace add ha-li/plugins
  /plugin install <plugin-name>@ha-li-plugins
  ```
  
  ## Plugins
  
  | Plugin | What it does |
  |---|---|
  | `git-init-repo` | Connects a repo to a new remote and does the first push safely. Blocks force pushes. |
  | `pr-commit-plugin` | Writes commit messages, and checks staged files for secrets first. |
  | `dumbass` | Rewrites Claude's last answer in plain language. | 
  
